                        Default value: <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">default</span>.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>HeaderStyle</td>
                    <td>string?</td>
                    <td>
                        Gets or sets the optional inline CSS values applied to a style attribute on the column's header cell.
                        Default value: <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">null</span>.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>CellStyle</td>
                    <td>string?</td>
                    <td>
                        Gets or sets the optional inline CSS values applied to a style attribute added to every cell in the column.
                        Default value: <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">null</span>.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>DisplayName</td>
                    <td>string</td>
                    <td>Gets or sets the text shown in the column header. Default to the field name if not entered.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>CellFormat</td>
                    <td>string?</td>
                    <td>
                        Gets or sets the optional .NET format string applied to the cell's value, e.g. for dates or numbers.
                        Default value: <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">null</span>.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>ColumnAlignment</td>
                    <td>ColumnAlignment (enum)</td>
                    <td>
                        Horizontal alignment applied to the column's header and cells.
                        Default value: <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">ColumnAlignment.Start</span>.
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </section>

    <section class="code-table">
        <h3 id="data-table-methods" class="code-table__heading">DataTable component methods</h3>

        <table aria-labelledby="data-table-methods">

            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Return</th>
                    <th scope="col">Method</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Task</td>
                    <td>SetTableFocus()</td>
                    <td>
                        Programmatically using JavaScript sets focus on the table element.
                        and applies a temporary modifier class to ensure that a focus indicator
                        is visible around the table whilst it has this focus.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>TData?</td>
                    <td>GetAdjacentDisplayedRow(TData rowItem)</td>
                    <td>
                        Returns the row adjacent to <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">rowItem</span> in the currently displayed order — the
                        next row if one exists, otherwise the previous row, otherwise default if rowItem was the only
                        displayed row.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Task</td>
                     <td>Refresh()</td>
                    <td>
                        Forces the table to re-filter, re-sort, and re-page from <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">DataSource</span> 
                        Call this after mutating the existing DataSource list in place (e.g. Add/Remove/Clear) rather than
                        assigning a new List instance, since in-place mutation is not detected automatically.
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </section>

    <section class="code-table">

        <h3 id="pager-binding-class" class="code-table__heading">PagerBinding class</h3>
        <p>
            This class just holds and binds the information used by both the pager and the data table.
        </p>
        <table aria-labelledby="pager-binding-class">

            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Type</th>
                    <th scope="col">Property</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>int</td>
                    <td>ItemsPerPage</td>
                    <td>
                        The number of rows to display per page.
                        Defaults to <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">10</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>int</td>
                    <td>CurrentPage</td>
                    <td>
                        The page currently being displayed.
                        Defaults to <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">0</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>int</td>
                    <td>CurrentItemCount</td>
                    <td>
                        he number of rows in the current filtered/unfiltered data set.
                        Defaults to <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">0</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>int</td>
                    <td>TotalItemCount</td>
                    <td>
                        The total number of rows available before filtering.
                        Defaults to <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">0</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="3">
                        <b>Constructor:</b><br />
                        PagerBinding(int itemsPerPage = 10)
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

    </section>
</section>
