<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">CSS variables defined for the pager component.</h2>

    <p>
        The following sections outline all of the css variables that can be set to alter the styling of the pager component.
        You can of course also override its style classes directly.
    </p>

    <section class="code-table">

        <h3 id="table-outline-variables" class="code-table__heading">Table outline variables</h3>
        <p>
            For a focus indicator around the table is circumstances when the table has to receive focus.
        </p>
        <table aria-labelledby="table-outline-variables">

            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Variable Name</th>
                    <th scope="col">Default Value</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-data-table-outline-style</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-outline-style)</td>
                    <td>The style of the outline - uses the shared variable.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-data-table-outline-width</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-outline-width)</td>
                    <td>The width of the outline - uses the shared variable.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-data-table-outline-offset</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-outline-offset)</td>
                    <td>The outline offset - uses the shared variable.</td>
                </tr>
